# Walkthrough: Tenant-Branded Certificate Generation

We have successfully implemented a state-of-the-art certificate generation system. This feature allows tenants to personalize their certificates and ensures students receive verified proof of their achievements only after meeting all course requirements.

## 1. Tenant Branding Management
Administrators can now customize their certificates from the **Branding Settings** page.
- **Logo & Signature**: Upload custom branding assets.
- **Theme Color**: Set a brand-specific accent color using a live color picker.
- **Live Preview**: See exactly how certificates will look to students before saving changes.

## 2. Automated Eligibility Gating
The system enforces strict rules for certificate issuance:
- **Lesson Completion**: Students must complete 100% of the lessons in a course.
- **Assessment Success**: If a course includes a final quiz, students must achieve a passing score before they can claim their certificate.

## 3. Student Experience
- **Course Player Integration**: A "Claim Certificate" button appears automatically in the curriculum sidebar once the student is eligible.
- **Unified Certificates Dashboard**: Students can view all their earned certifications in one place at `/certificates`, with options to download or share.

## Technical Highlights
- **PDF Engine**: Powered by `DomPDF` for consistent, high-quality document generation.
- **Security**: Certificate numbers are uniquely generated and verified against the student's enrollment record.
- **Performance**: Assets are served via local storage with URL helpers to ensure fast loading in PDF templates.

---
> [!TIP]
> To test the flow, login as an admin to set your branding, then complete a course as a student to see your custom-branded certificate in action!
